13. Data the Software sends

The Software can send anonymous usage statistics and crash reports to the copyright holder, and checks for updates, as described in the privacy notice at https://lila-3d.github.io/docs/#/privacy. Usage statistics and crash reports are optional: they can be turned off at any time in the Software's preferences, with the DO_NOT_TRACK or LILA_NO_TELEMETRY environment variables, or for an organisation through its studio preferences. They never include your files, file names, scene content or user names.

